    "topic": "Digital Nomad Programs for U.S. Citizens Sorted by USD Exchange Rate Leverage",
    "overview": "The user requested a current list of countries offering bona fide digital nomad or remote work visas for U.S. citizens, ranked by the exchange rate leverage of the U.S. dollar. This means sorting countries by how many units of local currency one U.S. dollar can buy, as of November 2, 2025. The goal is to identify destinations where the USD has the strongest purchasing power, potentially maximizing affordability for digital nomads.",
    "key_insights": [
